/**
 * lexer.mjs -- hand written SQL scanner.
 *
 * The reference implementation walks an ordered list of patterns at every
 * position and takes the first one that matches.  The same order is kept here,
 * with each pattern re-expressed as an explicit character scan; every scanner
 * returns the number of consumed characters (or -1 for "no match").
 *
 * The concatenation of all token values is always exactly the input text, so
 * the splitter can rebuild statements by joining values.
 */

